A, changed. B, change. C, changing.

93
00:05:57.667 --> 00:05:59.469
The answer is A: changed.

94
00:06:00.617 --> 00:06:02.814
Never stopping learning is blank learning.

95
00:06:03.114 --> 00:06:07.011
A, continuous. B, adaptive. C, forward.

96
00:06:10.567 --> 00:06:12.775
The answer is A: continuous.

97
00:06:13.917 --> 00:06:17.193
A new chance that is just appearing is an blank opportunity.

98
00:06:17.493 --> 00:06:20.822
A, emerging. B, changing. C, growing.

99
00:06:24.367 --> 00:06:26.552
The answer is A: emerging.

